{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "43516ee49cb2f13e6ae2f4228be15f89c41f58232363c6d341f80bfa8ba3670e", "ja": "クラゲ×ステップ＝くるくる", "zh": "水母×舞步＝转圈圈", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3b3b0e9c8f2da3746523f630c0a851623838115bded6259ea2563c899907107d", "ja": "公演に向けてレッスンが始まる。エミリーは\n反骨精神の影響で、気合いたっぷり。\nジュリアは難しいステップに焦りを感じる。\n時間が来てもレッスンを続けようとする\nジュリアをプロデューサー達は諭すが……。", "zh": "众人开始进行公演的特训。\n艾蜜莉受到反骨精神的影响而充满干劲，\n面对困难舞步的茱莉亚则感到焦躁。\n见到茱莉亚超过时限仍想继续练习，\n制作人与其他成员一同好言相劝，然而……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "31216b4b52dd049ec33dcb9a9693595eb0692635cd9c374c666880c6344d322b", "ja": "（今日から、エターナルハーモニーの\n本格的なレッスンが始まる。みんなの様子は……）", "zh": "（今天起『Eternal Harmony』要正式展开特训。\n不知道大家状况如何……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "a4f9a6c77325666064a6364f2e6cdaf3b15f7496b828944f52f39b9cd05bbeca", "ja": "先日の反骨精神音楽祭、本当に素敵でした……。\n私達の舞台も素敵なものとなるよう、頑張りましょう！", "zh": "前几天的反骨精神音乐祭，真的很精采……\n为了让我们的表演也能同样精采，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "3002b30670660f1cc5461e3475ec24a04bf728d96a4f8653a7829881a9e2871a", "ja": "ロックフェス、とっても楽しかったのです。\n姫たちも、ぱわほー！に歌うのです。", "zh": "摇滚祭实在很开心的喔。\n公主我们也要唱得很强大的唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ab140835277333496953870ce4d2bf350bf047176d87bcb2216913df196730bf", "ja": "うん。あんな風にのびのびと歌えたら、\nきっと盛り上がるライブになるよね♪", "zh": "嗯，要是能用那种不受束缚的风格演唱，\n一定能大大带动演唱会的气氛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "89541c205836a2db9e32c4725834a57cb1f9cac2ffdf43e2a860b2962f19b83f", "ja": "ロックフェス、みんなにとって\nいい刺激になったみたいだな。", "zh": "看来去参加摇滚祭，\n对大家来说是很好的刺激呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "3b76213e1d258b4402d0245314ee9934cac09fbd0a843a02c5dc4b1b00692bfa", "ja": "はい、とても。\n……誘ってくれてありがとう、ジュリア。", "zh": "是啊，非常受用。\n……谢谢你邀我们去，茱莉亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "dd08d89263947bdad4ad2e27aea69cbcfa01db852bf49b03fe818be37aabaf54", "ja": "こっちこそ、ノッてくれてサンキュ。\nみんなといろいろ見られて、楽しかったよ。", "zh": "我才要谢谢你们接受我的提议。\n能和大家一起增长见闻，我很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "7010ae8a3b30488667806cd5ef40d176850929f3c3c359ea4e1bb91403dcc16f", "ja": "さてと、今度はウチらの番だ。\nウチらだけの、歌の魂を探そうぜ！", "zh": "好啦，接下来就轮到我们了。\n来寻找专属于我们的『歌曲的灵魂』吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "16c3c927cbbe437fb537aff19d9a1b5c6becc632aaf6358e4f60cddbcfe7091a", "ja": "ええ！（おー♪）", "zh": "好的！（好──♪）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "ebcfe7b4a840ae5f7a1a7aa77442725c00339ef4ca9e48ad4c236e9030cca46d", "ja": "おー♪", "zh": "好──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ebcfe7b4a840ae5f7a1a7aa77442725c00339ef4ca9e48ad4c236e9030cca46d", "ja": "おー♪", "zh": "好──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "ebcfe7b4a840ae5f7a1a7aa77442725c00339ef4ca9e48ad4c236e9030cca46d", "ja": "おー♪", "zh": "好──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8bde6aa46bc48edbbec102dfe435e99258f2a0d55904cf73335c3ea7679f0c36", "ja": "（まずは、順番に歌のレッスンだ。\n千早、ジュリアはひとまずOKと。次は……）", "zh": "（首先是大家依序进行歌唱训练。\n千早和茱莉亚目前算是OK了，那么下一个是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "e4962a81342f0bbee2e9c0adfb5d8a30a1228700bc899b5e0b55369712a748e2", "ja": "らー！　らーらー！　らー！", "zh": "啦～！啦～啦～！啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "79599dab3939ee11abe522051b49209414228c3ea5b7f6184a942277599f302f", "ja": "エミリー。元気なのはいいことだけど、\nちょっと力みすぎじゃないか？", "zh": "艾蜜莉，有活力是好事，\n但你会不会有点太用力了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "956e43b3732b721d1ecfa4de48171baff6d54ec094d9f9a186185b1ce6203112", "ja": "そ、そうでしたか！？　すみません、\n反骨精神のようにと思ったら、つい力が……。", "zh": "会、会吗！？对不起，\n我想说要像反骨精神那样，就不小心太用力了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "4eb08961f2377d9308feebf603199b5abff2a992de16b5350bc804de57edc651", "ja": "え？　それ、ロックの影響だったのか？\nカワイイせいか、ちっとも気づかなかったぜ……。", "zh": "咦？原来那是受到摇滚的影响吗？\n大概是因为太可爱了，我完全没察觉到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "19d699d95f350494b21dde69319437ea8df00c94188db00ef069337226cca1c7", "ja": "ふふっ、そうね。\nロックというには、ちょっと可愛らしいかも。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。\n要说这是摇滚，可能有点太可爱了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4f9bf1830b9baa208d93b435240c9658346d14da55fb8dcc90ae923cbff4c791", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、肩の力を抜いて。\nリラックス、リラックス♪", "zh": "艾蜜莉，不要那么紧绷。\n放轻松、放轻松♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "eab8e496da75d0bbbe4d90cca3f9eb2ee0b83177905054fb739931b140095993", "ja": "は、はい！\n……といっても、どうしたら良いのか……うぅ。", "zh": "好、好的！\n……话虽如此，该怎么做才好呢……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1020_021mat", "source_sha256": "68a42ddc263a9bfe067956a0401eaa79fe10fba5fdea5cfd0a17a3795fb2ef16", "ja": "エミリーちゃん、姫が良いことを教えてあげるのです。\nずばり……クラゲになるのです！", "zh": "小艾蜜莉，公主来告诉你一个小秘方的喔。\n简单来说……就是要变成水母的唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "cd8ed9c0f29403e3f1ffdfaa3133ba1623764f5c126efa87c0fcaaaf9cf2d5aa", "ja": "えっ？　あの、くらげ……ですか？", "zh": "咦？你是说，水母吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "2fbd831bbd00383ca30438f03e2e916ddeb08f757d36daf6b4830ed98b7984ea", "ja": "クラゲなのです！　ふわふわでぷかぷかな\nクラゲのお姫様になって、海をふよふよ泳ぐのです。", "zh": "就是水母的唷！要变成轻飘飘又会漂浮的水母公主，\n在海里荡漾浮游的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "bf27343c417192f1138ca656075e50834cb7e17040f9fb98335e9f960904a27a", "ja": "クラゲになれば、肩に力は入らないのですよ♪", "zh": "变成水母，身体就不会太用力了喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "93c7e06e21cc08185c9ca330a7849c21e840d72a886345006deaaab7d287ce61", "ja": "ふよふよ……？　えーっと……\n{$P$}さんは、わかりますか？", "zh": "荡漾……？呃……\n{$P$}先生，你听得懂吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1025_p", "source_sha256": "b73476030fea0c2d74c65da7eeccca30ae701f1f761e704cc6d79360ce3acac8", "ja": "えっと、つまり……。クラゲは泳ぐ時、\n難しいことを考えているわけじゃないから……。", "zh": "这个嘛，意思就是……水母在游泳时，\n并没有在想什么复杂的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "6a1ad4a48ed4d24009c23a7b96b21d8a6ac7ea681e28f212e84468bb7a30847f", "ja": "エミリーも、難しく考えずに自然体で歌えばいい\n……ってことでいいのか、まつり？", "zh": "所以艾蜜莉也别想得太复杂，\n很自然地放声歌唱就好……是这个意思吗，茉莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "75d7bd969b2e2f9addebcfa05393cfa3c891838342ed834f385353aa07ce7823", "ja": "さすが、姫の{$P$}さんなのです♪\nバッチリなのです！", "zh": "公主的{$P$}先生果然很厉害的喔♪\n完全正确的唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1028_032emi", "source_sha256": "8c15ec0e6595df5200b7308451dcfca1f2a1c6cc61078679435648ba368ae0a7", "ja": "自然体……やってみます！　まつりさん、\n仕掛け人さま、助言をありがとうございます♪", "zh": "很自然地放声歌唱……我试试看！\n茉莉、策划执行人先生，谢谢你们的建言♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1029_032emi", "source_sha256": "dbdfbad6aa613897c7dab1cc4a96a867705b3e106f9b69b492ce4fc4e7787f19", "ja": "えっと、自然体……。\nゆっくりと、肩の力を抜くように……ふぅ……。", "zh": "呃，要自然……\n慢慢放松身体的力道……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1030_p", "source_sha256": "d547eb03a460d99fca6092f5ef4d33d6d0bd97047bb654a7627e2ff94918d697", "ja": "（次はダンスか。千早にまつり、風花は問題なし……\nエミリーも、こっちはバッチリだな。残るは……）", "zh": "（接下来是舞蹈练习。千早、茉莉和风花都没问题……\n艾蜜莉也在这方面无可挑剔。再来就只剩……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "6f30b1ddc2a8ac7868165fe78a4fae049aaed98e92358b7465ae8f5b8184cc19", "ja": "う、うわあ！？", "zh": "唔、唔哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1032_se", "source_sha256": "07240bef2e6303fd2a869c95197a55f80ceecc8e397b82b4010d0e326f3796b6", "ja": "ドターン！", "zh": "咚──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "64e2336473850b955ecb3e41459641affda6040d585dfa5ca0881efb1b996c7a", "ja": "あいたたたた……くぅ。", "zh": "痛痛痛痛……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "8d0e57fdfe4bf547470a2ae20eb0f87ad236db6d77292453a066ee8fc84bc1b9", "ja": "大丈夫か？\n盛大に転んだな、ジュリア。", "zh": "没事吧？\n茱莉亚，你跌得好重。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1035_050jul", "source_sha256": "cc0080ec75a9fdb50a5492be4210ace497fa2c1444a0e344f9a84509dddf5998", "ja": "ああ、なんてことない。このくらい平気だ。\nとはいえ、参ったな……できてないのはあたしだけか。", "zh": "嗯，我没事，这点程度不算什么。\n但真伤脑筋啊……就只剩我还不会跳吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1036_041fuk", "source_sha256": "83f1118f56f10063576cc52f43510757841fded69ec7263a50dee6d1e3784b5d", "ja": "でもたしかに、このステップ、\nちょっと難しいんですよね……。", "zh": "不过，\n这段舞步确实有点难呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1037_041fuk", "source_sha256": "891d51a711d83e646d7ba453886ca0beaf87d158100673a95fac1e538e607cb8", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n振り付けを変えるのは難しいですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n要改舞步会有困难吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1038_050jul", "source_sha256": "c693bb3510323203fc600b5cef10ff037c200cb44aeecfcd5c0afbbc6814ea28", "ja": "いや、フーカ、今のままでいい。このステップは、\nこの歌の良さを引き出すためにあるんだ。", "zh": "不用，风花，维持现在这样就好。\n毕竟设计这段舞步，就是为了衬托出这首歌的优点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1039_050jul", "source_sha256": "b3222d9f6f4a1eac70b2fb738dd8c9378bfc39f5c39971e0fc0bfa9bb2bf7d6c", "ja": "あたしのために妥協する必要なんかないよ。\nあたしができるようになればいい、それだけさ。", "zh": "没必要为了我妥协。\n只要我学会跳就好，就是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1040_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bae054d588ce5f446696ffccb1369ba741960cef1c3c389a901ad2f9169a6915", "ja": "ジュリアちゃん……。", "zh": "茱莉亚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1041_050jul", "source_sha256": "8a8cdfee35937c89a77877dc91e2169930ebb1a177baa08fa35cbea5eb37f29f", "ja": "ホラホラ、時間がもったいないぜ。\nさ、レッスン再開だ！", "zh": "好了好了，别浪费时间了。\n来吧，继续训练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1042_002chi", "source_sha256": "0e1b138bb6eb50aa9c4fbae6356df46c38f35241cc6442161bbe35dfdec65f71", "ja": "はぁ……、みんな、お疲れさま。\n今日はここまでにしましょう。", "zh": "呼……大家辛苦了。\n今天就到此为止吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1043_032emi", "source_sha256": "6337bbade3deac21e0b9d9a47dab1400b4b500dad80a327c2973c7317972387e", "ja": "ジュリアさん。\n練習はもう終わりですよ……？", "zh": "茱莉亚，\n练习已经结束了喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1044_050jul", "source_sha256": "886d336d02fc7c270905b71ad0ab4fce8c8f0bfc47fac24a5267706d856237be", "ja": "ああ、わかってる。\nけどあたしだけ、みんなと比べて全然踊れてない。", "zh": "嗯，我知道。\n不过跟大家相比，只有我完全跳不好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1045_050jul", "source_sha256": "c8ee352a45b4655a98517a3c29d71e05e4a080375911b37001c4abda044d5a9f", "ja": "サビのステップだけでも、\n今日中にできるようにならないと……。", "zh": "我想要在今天之内，\n至少学会跳副歌的舞步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1046_p", "source_sha256": "7f0e69fac77809374cf4d84bb13af7895eef52c1a12eb31ce323928e8733a391", "ja": "ジュリア、今日はもう終わりにしよう。\nこれ以上やると、ケガに繋がるかもしれない。", "zh": "茱莉亚，今天就先练到这里吧。\n再继续跳下去，搞不好会受伤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1047_050jul", "source_sha256": "9fb2abe4bdd201e1b7015c4b574c23d4a8b12f65bbe9643c8a7afcea42e7308e", "ja": "けど、{$P$}。", "zh": "可是，{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1048_002chi", "source_sha256": "eb59b74ba550f4c0168b10d49a339b4b751f59054450059a84c2263f6f22b494", "ja": "{$P$}の言うとおり。\nジュリア、焦る必要はないわ。", "zh": "{$P$}说得对。\n茱莉亚，你不必着急。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1049_002chi", "source_sha256": "0c886d173b11deffe267a9e1bafe67d367c72111fcecd0a2c30f42eaf79f0c46", "ja": "もちろん、ダンスはそろえたいけれど。\nでも、全員がまったく同じである必要もないと思う。", "zh": "舞蹈能整齐划一固然最好，\n但也没必要所有人都跳得一模一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1050_002chi", "source_sha256": "de0e3fd5f70f39429a2fd69896ecbdc892132338a1ebd9efe017601e0374e200", "ja": "歌声がひとりひとり違うように、\nそれぞれのペースで頑張りましょう、ジュリア。", "zh": "就好比每个人的歌声都各有差异，\n大家以各自的步调一起努力就好了，茱莉亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1051_050jul", "source_sha256": "44eef06f40ec2ab37b8c2fb5191fb41f54a296c03426f543291aae6db4981460", "ja": "チハ……。", "zh": "千……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1052_021mat", "source_sha256": "1fbd45ab1ccf4ebc5386e5a86b34b493a15c6bef134b50e9e5ebab17751c0d7e", "ja": "急がばくるくる回れ、なのです。\nジュリアちゃん、焦っちゃダメなのです。ね？", "zh": "「欲速则原地转圈圈」的喔。\n小茱莉亚，这是急不来的唷，呐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1053_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3d7062ec02b6109728a171fc9b028eaa0772cabb8dfd7f6d96572bcbd9a44d3c", "ja": "そうだね。私たちには、私たちのペースがあるもの。\nジュリアちゃん、膝擦りむいてるところ手当しようか。", "zh": "就是说啊，我们有我们的步调嘛。\n茱莉亚，我帮你处理膝盖的擦伤吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1054_050jul", "source_sha256": "27ce866a6e33c971eb2ba5e83ec99288978fac89bbbd234b72004811241ee2e0", "ja": "みんな……ごめん。\nありがとう……。", "zh": "大家……抱歉。\n谢谢你们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1055_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c8ab2860858c9a2aa8c059ea849d9f16c1c73d8eeb434867dd7dee282d1544a6", "ja": "謝る必要なんてないよ。\nみんなで一緒に、頑張ろうね！", "zh": "你不必道歉啦。\n大家一起努力加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1056_002chi", "source_sha256": "b55a8cff06f8ea29f8b68338fe860c892925571c6bd564a84186d32c5e3d1c4c", "ja": "私たちエターナルハーモニーは、\n5人のユニット。5人で頑張りましょう。", "zh": "我们『Eternal Harmony』是五人团体。\n五个人一起携手努力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1057_050jul", "source_sha256": "a45e737cefdcceeaa6c65170706f22f238027916c3a764c81f05f91c68cc7384", "ja": "……ああ！", "zh": "……好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0033_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0033_story_03_1058_p", "source_sha256": "64eb040f148e910a39273c3174b40bffbd407b31167f1e4882118a3923b7a553", "ja": "（今日のレッスンで、それぞれの課題が見えたな。\nジュリア、あまり無理をしなければいいが……）", "zh": "（透过今天的训练，可以看出每个人该努力的课题。\n希望茱莉亚不要太勉强自己才好……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
